[Event "12 - Dutch: Fianchetto the Bishop"]
[Site "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oypHzyjyBz8&t=3183s"]
[Date "2025.??.??"]
[Round "12"]
[White "Aman Hambleton repertoire"]
[Black "Dutch"]
[Result "*"]

1. d4 f5 2. c4 e6 3. g3 {The fianchetto targets dark squares and gives the c1-bishop a useful diagonal.} 3... c6 4. Bg2 Nf6 5. Nf3 d5 6. O-O Bd6 7. b3 Qe7 8. a4 Na6 9. Ba3 Bxa3 10. Nxa3 O-O 11. Nc2 {Control e5 and improve the pieces before forcing e4.} *

