[Event "14 - Albin Countergambit"]
[Site "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PtBjKCVo2so&t=3209s"]
[Date "2025.??.??"]
[Round "14"]
[White "Aman Hambleton repertoire"]
[Black "Albin Countergambit"]
[Result "*"]

1. d4 d5 2. c4 e5 3. dxe5 d4 4. a3 {Prepare b4 and reduce the force of Bb4+ ideas.} 4... c5 5. e3 Nc6 6. Nf3 Bg4 7. Be2 f6 8. Nxd4 cxd4 9. Bxg4 Nxe5 10. exd4 Nxg4 11. Qxg4 {The advanced d-pawn must be challenged, but only after checking the tactics.} *

[Event "15 - Piece Recapture: Build the Centre"]
[Site "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a4qOTCiVejg&t=298s"]
[Date "2025.??.??"]
[Round "15"]
[White "Aman Hambleton repertoire"]
[Black "Early Nxd5"]
[Result "*"]

1. d4 d5 2. c4 Nf6 3. cxd5 Nxd5 4. e4 {A piece recapture means no Black pawn restrains e4.} 4... Nf6 5. Nc3 Nc6 6. Nf3 e6 7. Bd3 Bb4 8. O-O O-O 9. a3 Be7 10. Re1 b6 11. e5 {Use the space, but expect Black's c5 counterbreak when it is available.} *
